		    Annotation {
		    SID			    "980"
		    Name		    "Some time after the function is in the hold position, leakage starts to transfer some of the borne we"
		    "ight to static friction between the piston and cylinder bore, which we can't measure.  So we only allow measurem"
		    "ent for a certain time after the hold position.  If one day it becomes desirable to be able to measure for longe"
		    "r, this could be possible by removing the expiration (or making it longer) and introducing some model of leakage"
		    " to compensate and produce an \"effective\" pressure instead of actual pressure.  Effective pressure would repre"
		    "sent the expected static friction force as pressure.  CPM already does something like this for the lift cylinder"
		    "s."
		    Position		    [334, 373, 655, 502]
		    InternalMargins	    [0, 0, 0, 0]
		    FixedHeight		    on
		    FixedWidth		    on
		    ZOrder		    -10
		    }
		    }
		    }
